{"unit_id":"derkinL__dsh-remembers#card-zh","repo":"derkinL/dsh-remembers","commit":"5ba47ddbf3974c7375920cfc1155d6987afa24b8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remembers 是面向 DSH web 客户端的长期记忆与人格陪伴插件。它在 agent 会话钩子中注入人格、关系画像、当前状态和按需召回的相关记忆，并把对话记录交给 companion-memory 服务保存。功能包括分层记忆与混合检索、自动捕获和可选事实抽取、日记及活动记录、表情包和 B 站工具，以及用于配置服务、人格和记忆的设置面板。适合希望 DSH 在连续对话中记住事实、保持角色设定并记录日常互动的用户。需要运行独立 Python 服务；基础检索不要求模型密钥，LLM 抽取与向量检索需自行配置对应服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:38","index.mjs:626","client.mjs:85","service/memory_core.py:700","service/server.py:183"]}
{"unit_id":"derkinL__dsh-remembers#card-en","repo":"derkinL/dsh-remembers","commit":"5ba47ddbf3974c7375920cfc1155d6987afa24b8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-remembers adds long-term memory and persona context to DSH. Hooks inject profiles and relevant memories from a Python service. It offers hybrid search, optional LLM extraction, diaries, activities, tools, and web settings. Run the service separately; model keys are optional for BM25 recall.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:38","index.mjs:626","client.mjs:85","service/memory_core.py:700","service/server.py:183"]}
